#: main.cpp:233
msgid ""
"<h1>Desktop</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to choose various options\n"
"for your desktop, including the way in which icons are arranged, the\n"
"location of your desktop directory, and the pop-up menus associated\n"
"with clicks of the middle and right mouse buttons on the desktop.\n"
"Use the \"Whats This?\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Desktop</h1>\n"
"Module na`y cho phe'p ba.n cho.n nhie^`u tuy` cho.n \n"
"cho desktop cu?a ba.n, bao go^`m ca'ch ca'c icon ddu+o+.c bo^' tri., \n"
"vi. tri' cu?a thu+ mu.c desktop, va` ca'c popup menu xa?y ra khi click tra'i, pha?i,"
"giu+~a va`o desktop .\n"
"Du`ng \"Ca`i na`y la` gi`?\" (Shift + F1) dde^? co' tro+. giu'p ve^` va^'n dde^` cu. the^? ."

#: previews.cpp:46
msgid "Allow previews on protocols:"
msgstr "Cho phe'p xem tru+o+'c tre^n mo.i giao thu+'c :"

#: previews.cpp:77
msgid ""
"This option makes it possible to choose when the file previews in the File "
"Manager should be activated.\n"
"In the list of protocols that appear, select which ones are fast enough for "
"you to allow previews to be generated."
msgstr ""
"Tuy` cho.n na`y la`m cho ba.n co' the^? cho.n khi xem tru+o+'c cu?a file trong "
"Tri`nh Qua?n Li' File ddu+o+.c ki'ch hoa.t . \n"
"Trong danh sa'ch ca'c giao thu+'c xua^'t hie^.n, cho.n ca'c ma` ddu? nhanh ddo^'i "
"vo+'i ba.n dde^? cho phe'p xem tru+o+'c ddu+o+.c sinh ra ."

#: previews.cpp:82
msgid "Maximum file size:"
msgstr "Co+~ file lo+'n nha^'t :"

#: previews.cpp:85
msgid "MB"
msgstr "MB"

#: previews.cpp:136
msgid ""
"<h1>Preview Options</h1> Here you can modify the behavior of Konqueror when "
"it shows the files in a directory.<h2>The list of protocols:</h2> check the "
"protocols over which previews should be shown, uncheck those over which they "
"shouldn't. For instance, you might want to show previews over SMB if the "
"local network is fast enough, but you might disable it for FTP if you often "
"visit very slow FTP sites with large images.<h2>Maximum File Size:</h2> "
"select the maximum file size for which previews should be generated. For "
"instance, if set to 1 MB (the default), no preview will be generated for "
"files bigger than 1 MB, for speed reasons."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Preview Options</h1> Here you can modify the behavior of Konqueror when "
"it shows the files in a directory.<h2>The list of protocols:</h2> check the "
"protocols over which previews should be shown, uncheck those over which they "
"shouldn't. For instance, you might want to show previews over SMB if the "
"local network is fast enough, but you might disable it for FTP if you often "
"visit very slow FTP sites with large images.<h2>Maximum File Size:</h2> "
"select the maximum file size for which previews should be generated. For "
"instance, if set to 1 MB (the default), no preview will be generated for "
"files bigger than 1 MB, for speed reasons."

