"Nha^.n tuy` cho.n na`y ne^'u ba.n muo^'n cha.y 1 chu+o+ng tri`nh X11 co' chu+'c na(ng"
"ve~ desktop nhu+ xsnow, xpenguin hay xmountain . Ne^'u ba.n co' va^'n ve^` vo+'i "
"nhu+~ng chu+o+ng tri`nh kie^?m tra cu+?a so^? go^'c cho running instance nhu+ netscape ,"
"ha~y bo? tuy` cho.n na`y ."

